hat one continues this."}}},"EventId":{"title":"EventId","description":"Opaque identifier of an event: `evt_` followed by 16 to 64 base64url characters. Random, community-scoped, never reused (VTI-EVT-001).","type":"string","pattern":"^evt_[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16,64}\$"},"EventAnonymity":{"title":"EventAnonymity","description":"What an `anonymous` event shows of its registration (VTI-EVT-213, 217, 218).","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["suite","pcsIdentity","classes","period","periodEndsAt","holderCount"],"properties":{"suite":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":64,"description":"The predicate-credential-system suite, as the community publishes it."},"pcsIdentity":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/EventMultibase","description":"The event\'s identity in the predicate credential system: what every attestation is made to (VTI-EVT-213)."},"classes":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"maxItems":33,"uniqueItems":true,"items":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/EventClassLabel"},"description":"The live class labels of the event\'s audience; an attestation under any of them is accepted."},"period":{"type":"string","pattern":"^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}(-[0-9]{2})?\$","description":"The community\'s current period."},"periodEndsAt":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/EventInstant","description":"When the current period ends: a party that stops being a member keeps their credential until then (VTI-EVT-218)."},"holderCount":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"description":"How many members hold a credential for a live class of the audience in the current period (VTI-EVT-217)."}}},"EventInstant":{"title":"EventInstant","type":"string","format":"date-time","description":"An RFC 3339 instant in UTC, whole seconds, such as `2026-11-30T18:30:00Z`."},"EventClassLabel":{"title":"EventClassLabel","type":"string","maxLength":200,"pattern":"^(member|group/[A-Za-z0-9_-]{4,80})/[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}(-[0-9]{2})?\$","description":"A class label (VTI-EVT-212): `member/<period>` for the membership, `group/<groupId>/<period>` for a group — 